WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:10.010
Have a good day, My Lady. Please take care.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.990
I shall be going now.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.460
I wonder what would happen if I ran away.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:56.220
I'm the world's unluckiest pretty girl, Harukaze Doremi!

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:01.220
Even so, someone like me got to become a witch apprentice!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.510
It's always been my dream to become a witch.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:09.690
So I was like, ultra-special happi-ppy that it actually happened to this pretty girl!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.650
Well, I still make mistakes here and there,

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:17.280
but I don't worry, I don't tell, and I don't care either.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.240
Even if I'm still a clumsy witch, we'll see about it later!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.500
I Become Hadzuki-chan!

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:48.930
I'm a witch!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.180
You're a witch <i>apprentice</i> !

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.020
Makihatayama Rika...

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.580
That's my name in the Human World!

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:00.070
Right!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.610
It's Majo Rika.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.240
Jeez, you're such an Ojamajo!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.320
Ojamajo?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.450
That's what you are!

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.400
Becoming a witch apprentice is not about the cool outfit!

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.360
Ever since you became a witch apprentice, you've been nothing but a bother!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.340
Do you understand, Ojamajo?

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.710
You're terrible!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.220
But, if your family sees you now, it's going to be trouble, right?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.550
Ahh... You're right.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:26.680
Oh, by the way!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.640
Hey, Lala!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.850
Can you refill my magic spheres?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:30.960
Those don't come from nowhere.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.880
They're not free, you know!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.520
You buy them in the Witch World.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.400
Eh, so that's how it is.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.000
Now that you know, starting tomorrow you have to work at my store.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:41.780
Okay.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.100
What!?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.320
Wait a sec!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.660
You made me like this, so you're going to do it for me!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.990
But, what about school?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:48.840
Skip!

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.880
Your plan can't work that way, can it?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:54.100
How about on days when you don't have school?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.040
Doremi!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.380
You can take your bath now.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.130
Sure. Got it.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.220
Hurry up and get in.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:09.770
Oh, by the way!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:10.720
What is it?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.840
You know, if you want a boyfriend,

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.640
I can give you mine.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:20.150
Why would I sink so low as to borrow a boyfriend from my kindergarten sister?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.530
Oh? If you don't want him, just say so.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.280
Jeez!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.410
Things don't look too good tonight.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.950
Looks like I have much to teach this Ojamajo.

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.100
Got no choice.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.670
Tomorrow, come to my store before school.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:38.180
Eh? Then I have to get up really early.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:39.920
Don't talk that way to me!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.940
Jeez! It's because of you I'm stuck in this form!

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.170
Be responsible for once!

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:44.880
See you tomorrow.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.470
What about the magic spheres?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.300
Tomorrow, if you come to my store.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.360
She's late!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:08.450
What was that?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.000
The magic spheres, please?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.960
This brat really is one impatient Ojamajo!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.300
Here we go.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.800
Wanna know what I think about her passing the level 9 exam?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.760
I don't think she has a shread of hope.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.220
Level 9?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.180
That's right.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:34.760
To be a witch, you must pass a series of exams, levels 9 through 1.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:35.920
Bleh!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:38.060
There are exams to become a witch?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.140
Of course.

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:40.480
I'll pass on that.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.560
You brat!

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:46.570
But, if you pass level 9, you'll get a fairy that's like me.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.940
Eh, really?

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:48.860
Cool!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:49.500
Okay, I'll take it!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:50.560
I'll take it now!

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:53.100
Let me take it now, please!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.240
You have no chance passing it now.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.320
Listen well.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.860
Once you have passed my magic training, then...

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.840
Ah! Shoot, I'm late!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.260
I'll talk to you again after school!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.000
You're going to school in that outfit?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.300
Oh, right!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.430
Jeez, that Ojamajo!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.420
Hadzuki-chan, good morning!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.360
Doremi-chan, good morning!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.780
Hey, hey, Hadzuki-chan!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.360
I'm actually going to become a witch...

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:31.950
A witch?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.450
Ah, ah, courageous like a witch! Just kidding!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.750
Doremi-chan, you always look so happy.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.620
I envy you.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.560
I'm the one who envies you, Hadzuki-chan.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.200
You're smart, your Papa is a drama director,

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.260
and your Mama is an interior coordinator.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.670
On top of that, your family is rich.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.630
I want to be you, Hadzuki-chan.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.050
Doremi-chan.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.480
You don't know what's happening in my house.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.220
It doesn't matter.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.600
I'm the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.940
I'd be ultra lucky and happy...

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.980
Enough already!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.650
Hadzuki-chan?

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.340
Why?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.190
Here! Here! Here!

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:10.660
Over here!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.870
She always raises her hand.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.120
Did I say something wrong?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.630
I wonder if she's angry.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.880
What's wrong?

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.130
Oh, Yuki-sensei.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:40.010
I don't think Hadzuki-chan is angry.

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.430
I don't think so either.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:44.380
Maybe something is bothering her?

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.900
Ah, it's true that she didn't seem cheerful earlier.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:50.980
Hadzuki-chan probably needs someone to listen to her problem.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:55.490
People look for happiness in different ways.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.000
Doremi-chan!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.380
Hadzuki-chan, I... I mean...

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.660
I'm sorry about this morning,

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.840
If I said something to hurt you.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:19.430
No, it's my fault that you think that way.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.270
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.940
So, we're still friends?

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.060
Yes.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.260
Hey, Hadzuki-chan.

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.530
Is something bugging you?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.560
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:40.080
But, only magic could help me.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.200
Magic?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.820
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:44.680
If you could use magic, what would you do?

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.720
I don't know...

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.360
I'd probably want to be you, Doremi-chan.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.980
Got it, wait here!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:52.740
Alright!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.850
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.780
Hadzuki-san!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.360
Eh?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.400
What is it, Doremi-chan?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.910
N-n-n-n-no, I'm not her!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.620
But...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.240
I'm a witch-friend of Doremi-chan's.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.540
I'll grant your wish.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.670
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.970
Hadzuki-chan, become Doremi-chan!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.320
I've really become Doremi-chan!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.000
A magic broom?

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.620
I'm going to turn Doremi-chan into Hadzuki-chan, okay?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.330
See ya!

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.590
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.470
Become Hadzuki-chan...!

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.520
I wonder if this is okay...

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:35.310
She's wasting her magic spheres on useless crap again.

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:37.400
Oh, she'll get better with time.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.220
Is this really okay, Doremi-chan?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.690
Everything's a-okay!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.200
I've always wanted to be you for once Hadzuki-chan.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.800
If you're okay, then I'm okay.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.670
Witches really do exist, don't they?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.160
Hadzuki-chan, you address your parents as Mama and Papa?

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.970
Yes. Doremi-chan, it's Mom and Dad for your parents?

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:58.460
Right!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.920
I'm so excited.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.470
Alright, I'm Doremi-chan.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.720
I'm Doremi-chan! I'm Doremi-chan!

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.280
I'm home.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.090
Pop-chan is so cute.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:49.680
Welcome home, Doremi.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:53.780
I'm home, Pop-chan.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:58.610
Pop-chaaaaan!?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.780
What are you doing, Pop-chan?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.700
I'm your big sister after all.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.990
Pop-chan.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.700
I get it!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.950
So you want me to introduce you to one of my boyfriends!

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.500
You don't have to refer to me with that suffix!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.240
Ah, you're making a paper crane?

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:20.900
Yeah.

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.720
If you are, you should do it this way.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.130
Please watch me carefully.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.800
Doremi, you're talking all weird.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.880
That's not true!

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:31.140
I mean... why do you think that, Pop-chan, I mean Pop?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.440
Well, take a look anyway.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.430
You do it like this... and then...

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.230
Mooooom!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.030
What? What is it?

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.490
Look at this!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.650
Doremi did this one!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:48.950
No way!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.410
It's true!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.530
Pointy ends.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.370
Hard to believe, right?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.410
That's right...

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.200
The real one wouldn't be able to make pointy ends.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.830
Sorry to bother you, but could any of you get the sauce fo-?

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:02.580
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:05.630
Could you check the bath-?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:06.300
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:07.750
Is the gate lock-?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.760
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.380
Yes, this is the Harukaze residence.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.510
Yes, my mother is currently in.

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:16.270
Yes, please wait while I get her.

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:26.570
I-I'm hom-

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.900
Welcome back, My Lady!!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.530
Aahhhh! I-I-I-I'm home!!!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:33.950
Ah, that scared me.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.280
She has Baaya-san to greet her, just like a proper lady.

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.490
Hadzuki-chan?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:39.910
Yes?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:41.920
Welcome back.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.320
I'm home, Mama.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.380
Ah, I called her "Mama!"

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.390
I bought you a new dress, want to see it?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.850
Sure, sure!

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.440
I got a call from Papa.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.140
He's not done at work yet,

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.720
so he said we should have dinner at a hotel.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.320
Dinner at a hotel?

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:58.140
Yes.

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:59.060
Alright!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.360
Hadzuki-chan, such uncouth language...

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.570
Hadzuki-chan, you're acting... weird.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.940
T-T-That's not true at all!

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.150
Really?

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:17.950
For dinner, would you like either Italian or French?

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.410
S-Steak!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.790
You just had steak yesterday.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.880
Yesterday was yesterday and today is today, Mama!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.880
If that's what Hadzuki-chan wants to eat, then that's fine.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.340
Thank you...

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.520
So, how is it?

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:33.880
Cute, isn't it?

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:37.800
Hmm, not used to so many frills on me.

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:41.010
What happened?

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:45.060
I bought you many like these before, and you never said anything.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.860
You really are acting weird!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.400
Ah, I'm not, I'm not!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.820
It's super okay!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:52.480
Hadzuki-chan...

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.460
Isn't it?

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:58.040
I always know which clothes suit Hadzuki-chan best.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.280
Okay then, I'm going to make arrangements for dinner.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:07.710
Hadzuki-chan's clothes are picked out by her mama.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.200
Dinner's almost ready, could you call your dad?

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:12.980
Eh?

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:14.000
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.660
She really is acting weird!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.100
Dad, dinner is almost ready.

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:33.160
Oh, what is that?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.410
It's a lure.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.060
Ah, it's pretty!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.420
Oh, you see it too, Doremi?

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.620
Yes, it looks like a pretty insect.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.740
I see.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.830
You want to learn about fly-fishing too!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.450
Dad is so happy!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.960
Uhm...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.750
Okay, Hadzuki-san, let's start from where we left off.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.560
Do your best, Hadzuki-chan.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.970
S-Steak... when?

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:03.390
Oh!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.600
Hadzuki-chan, what are you saying?

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.060
You're not thinking we're going to have dinner now, are you?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.150
I... guess not...

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.320
This is Dad's lure catalog.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.480
See? There are many different types.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.180
Dinner is ready!

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:20.330
What are you doing wasting your time in here!?

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.070
It's not a waste of time!

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:23.370
It's fly fishing!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.920
It's just fishing, there's no need to get so involved in it!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.200
You're ruining a father-daughter moment!

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:29.980
Butt out!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:34.790
Tell her about how you have to clean the fish!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:35.790
What about it?

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.960
What about it? Tell her the truth!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.850
Please stop it...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.380
Why? Why are you fighting?

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:49.240
Ow ow ow ow, my stomach!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.560
Kyaaa! Trouble!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.990
What's happening, Ma'am?

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.490
Hadzuki-chan is in pain!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.410
U-Understood!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.230
Take Hadzuki-chan to her bed!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:01.120
Yes, hurry!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.540
Ah, no, you don't have to go that far...

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.570
But we do! To your bed!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.870
Yes, hurry!
But we do! To your bed!

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.410
Steak...

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.500
Delicious!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.250
This is pretty good.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:21.270
It was on special sale.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.200
Why?

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:25.730
Why are they having a friendly dinner after all that fighting?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.050
You're not eating?

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.850
Ah, I don't really care that much for steak.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.490
Are you alright, Doremi?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.360
It's steak! <i>Steak</i> !

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.280
She really <i>is</i>  weird!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.340
It's probably a sickness.

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:38.880
Actually...

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.730
Go to sleep! Go to sleep!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.400
Uhm...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.700
Hadzuki, are you alright?

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:51.980
I don't see anything wrong with her.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.090
It must have been my imagination.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.380
Is that so?

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.430
I'm glad.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.180
As a precaution, for today she can only have liquids.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.000
Ah! My stomach is perfect now!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.200
Steak is okay! Okay!? Steak!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.520
You can't, Hadzuki-chan.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.240
That's right.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.350
You can eat steak anytime.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:10.310
But, if I can eat steak anytime...

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.720
For today, please listen to the doctor.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.280
Just behave and get some rest.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:16.860
Yes, sir.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:24.700
Living like a lady is pretty hectic, huh?

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.540
She was acting pretty weird.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.750
That was the reason I bought that steak.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.410
She doesn't have a fever.

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.970
Just let her sleep.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.940
This family has its troubles, but everyone is affectionate.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.810
I wish all families were like that.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.850
Ahh, I've returned to being myself!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.350
Does that mean...?

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.140
If I've turned back to myself, then Doremi-chan has too...

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:04.520
Ah, what do I do?

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:09.070
If I'm not home, Papa and Mama will be so worried.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:14.580
Nose plug!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.870
Ahh, I've had enough bad things happen already.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.920
Take a look at yourself!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.460
Whoa! I'm myself again!

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.420
That means Hadzuki-chan too?

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.350
That's right! Hurry up and get going!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.760
Hadzuki-chan, just wait!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.400
That clumsy brat!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:44.150
Hurry up!

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.860
I know that already!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.490
Alright!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.830
At this rate, I won't get home in time...

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.000
Huh?

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:05.710
Lala!

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:19.930
Ms. Witch?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:21.620
Sorry, sorry.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.020
The magic wore off.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.360
I'll recast it now.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:25.530
Wait.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:28.960
It's alright.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:33.200
Tricking Doremi-chan's family any longer would break my heart.

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:35.500
Hadzuki-chan...

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:42.240
I didn't eat dinner, so Doremi-chan's mom and dad were really worried.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:47.460
They fight from time to time, but Doremi-chan is important to them.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:48.630
That's why...

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.040
Hadzuki-chan too...

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:51.820
Eh?

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:52.860
I mean...

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.180
Doremi-chan was...

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:57.430
...trying to cut her violin practice by pretending to be sick.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:21:00.400
Because of that, she felt a lot of regret.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.220
Aren't your papa and mama kind?

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:04.400
Yes.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.060
I think so too.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:09.520
Ms. Witch, could you switch me and Doremi-chan back?

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:10.360
Yes.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.420
So, you didn't eat anything for dinner?

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:14.920
Yes, it was steak after all.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:15.580
Ahh! Steak!?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.360
Kyaa!
Ahh! Steak!?

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.450
Sorry, sorry!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.760
You had steak for dinner?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:20.780
Yes.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.640
So, Doremi-chan's portion was saved?

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:24.600
Yes, I think so.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.700
Alright!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.670
I mean... Doremi-chan will be so happy!

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.560
Eh!? You ate it!?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.680
That's right.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:37.430
It's not good leaving it in the refrigerator.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:40.820
But you know I love steak more than anything!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.260
Why did you eat it?

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:44.480
Doremi is back to normal.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.230
We're glad, we're glad.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.860
You people are mean!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:58.280
Ahh, I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.300
I'm Senoo Aiko.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.450
I'm from Osaka, but I'm really diggin' it here!

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:09.240
By the way, ain't Doremi-chan's hairstyle hilarious?

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:12.260
And ain't Hadzuki-chan kinda noodly?

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:17.010
Who is this fast-talking tactless girl?

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:19.630
At a time like this, let's go to the Maho-dou!

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:22.400
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:25.640
The Transfer Student From Naniwa! Aiko Debuts.

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:28.640
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
